Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ===================================================================
; Game No-Core-0 Optimizer: 30 Popular Games Preset
; Mask 0x0000FFFC (65532) for 8C/16T processors (Ryzen 7 9850X3D, 7800X3D, 5800X3D, 9700X, 7700X, etc.)
; Completely frees Core 0 (CPU 0 + CPU 1) for Windows OS & background tasks
; 0% background apps, 0 MB RAM, VAC / EAC / Vanguard safe
; ===================================================================

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Image File Execution Options\cs2.exe\PerfOptions]
"CpuAffinityMask"=dword:0000FFFC

